{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Evening Reader 是一款以單一琥珀色調呈現的閱讀 App，適合睡前閱讀、長時間看文章或希望減少螢幕刺眼感的用戶；原價 US $9.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-227.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>暖色護眼離線書庫</h2>\n<p>Evening Reader 以單一琥珀色調呈現頁面、文字與圖片，可調暖度、亮度、對比及夜間模式，並儲存常用預設。用戶可分享頁面、貼上連結或開啟書檔，文章保留文字與圖片，PDF 保留頁面，EPUB 保留封面、章節與目錄；所有內容均可離線保存。書庫以資料夾整理並經 iCloud Drive 同步，支援標註、筆記與跨裝置閱讀進度。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-274-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-275-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-276-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-277-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-278-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-279-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Evening Reader</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/evening-reader/id6806076273?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T17:55:00.699559+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T17:41:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T15:37:39.097509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T17:48:25.501695+00:00","content_hash":"a6549f18119d249d14f564993ac551f4ffdf4cd65be6ae4c4b1bb16eef63fab2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}